# Kaya, Spirits' Justice's -2: "Exile target creature you control. For each other player, exile up to one target creature that player
# controls." (CR 115.1, 601.2c) Bot1 exiles its own Memnite and Bot2's Ornithopter. Her first ability triggers for the creature Bot1 controlled
# only: "from among them" Bot1 can choose Memnite, never the opponent's Ornithopter (refused), and the Spirit token becomes a copy of Memnite
# with flying until end of turn: a 1/1 colorless artifact creature (no longer white and black). Loyalty 4 -> 2.

